  "comment": [
    "One entry per Windows medium the windows-matrix workflow measures. Adding a version is adding an entry.",
    "type: iso (a Windows ISO) or esd (an install ESD of the Media Creation Tool kind).",
    "mode: install (install the medium and measure the installed system, the default) or winpe (measure in the",
    "  Windows PE of the medium: faster, but without the feature overrides an installed system has).",
    "sha1: the SHA-1 published for the download; empty for Microsoft evaluation links, which publish none.",
    "Every medium is also checked against ci/kernel-hashes.tsv before it boots.",
    "edition: a regular expression for the image to install (first match).",
    "cpu: the QEMU CPU model of an x64 guest; the runner CPU is passed through unless stated.",
    "configurations: none (as shipped) or the EnabledState written to FeatureManagement override 3/1150694031."
